{"text":"They got medals for coming in last, they got participation medals, right? And the science of this is already good. We know that it devalues the feeling that somebody who works hard and comes in first place, and it actually makes the person who comes in last embarrass because they know they don't deserve it. So it actually makes them feel worse, it actually doesn't help. There are a lot of kids who got into honors classes, not because they deserved it, but because their parents complained, and they got A's not because they earned them, but because the teachers didn't want to deal with the parents, right? Then those kids graduate and they start a job, and in an instant they find out that they're not special, that you don't get anything just because you want it. You get nothing for coming in last, and your parents cannot help you get a promotion.","words":[{"text":"They","start":0.0,"end":0.66},{"text":"got","start":0.66,"end":0.86},{"text":"medals","start":0.86,"end":1.14},{"text":"for","start":1.14,"end":1.38},{"text":"coming","start":1.38,"end":1.6},{"text":"in","start":1.6,"end":1.72},{"text":"last","start":1.72,"end":1.94,"punct":","},{"text":"they","start":2.08,"end":2.1},{"text":"got","start":2.1,"end":2.22},{"text":"participation","start":2.22,"end":2.78},{"text":"medals","start":2.78,"end":3.3,"punct":","},{"text":"right","start":3.84,"end":4.2,"punct":"?"},{"text":"And","start":4.3,"end":4.42},{"text":"the","start":4.42,"end":4.54},{"text":"science","start":4.54,"end":4.8},{"text":"of","start":4.8,"end":4.94},{"text":"this","start":4.94,"end":5.06},{"text":"is","start":5.06,"end":5.22},{"text":"already","start":5.22,"end":5.48},{"text":"good","start":5.48,"end":5.8,"punct":"."},{"text":"We","start":5.88,"end":6.0},{"text":"know","start":6.0,"end":6.3},{"text":"that","start":6.3,"end":6.9},{"text":"it","start":6.9,"end":7.1},{"text":"devalues","start":7.1,"end":7.92},{"text":"the","start":7.92,"end":8.16},{"text":"feeling","start":8.16,"end":8.46},{"t